      "title": "1 \u2014 Percentage thresholds, no domain set",
      "description": "This panel uses percentage thresholds at 50% and 80%. Min and Max are not set, so Grafana uses the shared node range `[10, 90]`. The node medians use that range: `gateway` is 12%, `api` is 56%, `db` is 94%, and `cache` is 31%. A value change in any node field can change the shared range and the resulting colors.",
